        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For many visitors, sustainability is measured by solar panels, recycling bins, or environmental certifications. While these initiatives have their place, the story behind Riverside Cottages began long before sustainability became a marketing term. For more than twenty years, the people behind Riverside Cottages have helped support communities and conservation efforts across Southern Thailand. Their work has included environmental education and responsible tourism initiatives. These experiences helped shape the values that continue to guide Riverside Cottages today. This is the story behind our community-led tourism philosophy. It explains how local communities, conservation efforts, and responsible travel shaped the Riverside Cottages [...]
        </p>
